# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Toolchains, sources and downloaded artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reproduced by tools/bin/build-minio.sh, not committed. See
# docs/01-repo-versions-and-lab/evidence/minio-build-provenance.txt.
tools/go/
tools/gopath/
tools/src/
tools/dl/

# Vendored binaries. Each is checksum-verified at install time and the checksum
# is recorded in the evidence, so the file itself does not belong in git.
tools/bin/mc
tools/bin/mcli
tools/bin/gitleaks

# Compiled/staged build inputs. The MinIO binary is ~106 MB.
lab/images/minio/minio
lab/images/mc/mc

# Generic archive pattern, in case a new artefact is downloaded.
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lab credentials — must never be committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env.example IS tracked and holds placeholders only.
lab/compose/.env
.env
.env.local
*.env
!*.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cluster data and runtime state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MinIO and Silo write as root inside these bind mounts, so cleanup needs a
# container (see the Cleanup section of
# docs/01-repo-versions-and-lab/README.md) rather than a host rm.
lab/data/
lab/logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker volumes created by the workload project
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
mc-config/
silo-config/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent working material — not project content
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEV-904-project-documentation-pack/ is the instruction pack handed to the
# execution agent. It is reference material for the agent, not a project
# deliverable, and is deliberately never committed. The project records that
# matter from it are re-derived into DEVIATIONS.md and DEV-904-EXECUTION-PLAN.md.
DEV-904-project-documentation-pack/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
# Generated report output. tools/bin/build-docx.py is the source of truth; the
# .docx is a build artefact and is regenerated on demand.
docs/DEV-904-project-report.docx
